{"seq":2,"slug":"asset-image-localization","title":"资源与图像本地化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-localization/content/asset-image-localization","wordCount":1298,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"资源与图像本地化\">资源与图像本地化</h1><p>游戏里有一块路牌贴图写着 &quot;DANGER&quot;，一个成就图标画着竖大拇指，开场动画里有一段写满英文的报纸特写。这些文字和图像都嵌在美术资源里，<a href=\"../foundations/text-externalization\">字符串表</a>对它们无能为力——必须在资源层面替换。本篇讲资源与图像本地化：哪些资源要本地化、如何组织它们、如何按 locale 加载。它是<a href=\"../foundations/cultural-adaptation\">本地化层级</a> L3 的另一半，与配音并列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>可本地化资源的范围远超「贴图里的文字」。下表归纳常见类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>资源类型</th>\n<th>本地化原因</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>含文字贴图</td>\n<td>贴图里嵌了英文</td>\n<td>路牌、海报、UI 背景图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图标/符号</td>\n<td>文化含义不同</td>\n<td>手势、宗教符号、旗帜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>音频（非语音）</td>\n<td>文化关联音效</td>\n<td>节日音乐、提示音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过场动画</td>\n<td>画面含文字/敏感内容</td>\n<td>报纸特写、地图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>法律标识</td>\n<td>区域合规要求</td>\n<td>分级标志、健康提示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文档/卷轴道具</td>\n<td>游戏内可读文本</td>\n<td>书信、告示、菜单图</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>资源本地化的核心架构原则是：<strong>从设计期就把「可本地化资源」与「通用资源」分离</strong>，并建立按 locale 覆盖加载的机制。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[美术资源] --&gt; B{含文字/文化内容?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否 通用| C[shared 通用资源池&lt;br/&gt;所有 locale 共用]&#10;  B --&gt;|是 需本地化| D[按 locale 分目录]&#10;  D --&gt; E[assets/textures/en/sign.png]&#10;  D --&gt; F[assets/textures/zh-CN/sign.png]&#10;  D --&gt; G[assets/textures/ar/sign.png]&#10;  H[运行时按当前 locale] --&gt; I{该 locale 有覆盖?}&#10;  I --&gt;|有| J[加载 locale 专属资源]&#10;  I --&gt;|无| K[回退到默认/通用资源]&#10;  C --&gt; K\">flowchart TD\n  A[美术资源] --&gt; B{含文字/文化内容?}\n  B --&gt;|否 通用| C[shared 通用资源池&lt;br/&gt;所有 locale 共用]\n  B --&gt;|是 需本地化| D[按 locale 分目录]\n  D --&gt; E[assets/textures/en/sign.png]\n  D --&gt; F[assets/textures/zh-CN/sign.png]\n  D --&gt; G[assets/textures/ar/sign.png]\n  H[运行时按当前 locale] --&gt; I{该 locale 有覆盖?}\n  I --&gt;|有| J[加载 locale 专属资源]\n  I --&gt;|无| K[回退到默认/通用资源]\n  C --&gt; K</pre><h2 id=\"资源分离与命名约定\">资源分离与命名约定</h2><p>最常见的失败是把英文文字直接画进美术贴图，且没有无文字的底图。到本地化时才发现要让美术重做每张图、抠掉文字、再交给各语言重排——返工成本巨大。</p>\n<p>正确做法有两层。第一是<strong>美术与文字分层</strong>：贴图只画背景，文字用<a href=\"../technical/fonts-multilingual-rendering\">动态文本渲染</a>叠加在上面，这样换语言只需换字符串、不动美术。这是首选，能本地化的文字尽量别烧进贴图。</p>\n<p>第二是对确实必须烧进贴图的内容（如有特殊字体效果的标题图），采用<strong>按 locale 覆盖的资源约定</strong>。引擎通常提供机制：Unity 的 Addressables + Localization 包支持按 locale 加载资源变体，Unreal 的资源本地化用 <code>L10N/&lt;culture&gt;/</code> 目录覆盖同路径资源。命名上常用 locale 后缀或子目录（<code>logo_en.png</code> / <code>logo_zh-CN.png</code> 或 <code>en/logo.png</code>），运行时按当前 locale 解析，缺失则回退到默认 locale——这与<a href=\"../technical/fonts-multilingual-rendering\">字体回退</a>和<a href=\"../foundations/text-externalization\">文本回退</a>是同一种「缺失即回退」的设计哲学。按 locale 解析资源路径的逻辑大致如下：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"lua\" data-code=\"-- 先查 locale 专属，缺失则回退到默认 locale（en）&#10;function resolveAsset(path, locale)&#10;  local localized = &quot;assets/&quot; .. locale .. &quot;/&quot; .. path&#10;  if assetExists(localized) then return localized end&#10;  return &quot;assets/en/&quot; .. path&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 先查 locale 专属，缺失则回退到默认 locale（en）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function resolveAsset(path, locale)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  local localized = \"assets/\" .. locale .. \"/\" .. path</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if assetExists(localized) then return localized end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return \"assets/en/\" .. path</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"按区域加载与包体优化\">按区域加载与包体优化</h2><p>支持十几种语言意味着资源量成倍增长。若把所有语言的所有资源都打进安装包，包体会膨胀到不可接受——这对<a href=\"../../mobile-game-development/\">移动平台</a>尤其致命，应用商店有包体上限，玩家也不愿下载几个 GB。</p>\n<p>解决方案是<strong>按 locale 分包、按需下载</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>资源分包（asset bundles / Addressables groups）</strong>：把各 locale 的本地化资源（含<a href=\"voiceover-subtitles\">配音</a>、贴图）拆成独立包，玩家选了某语言才下载对应包。配音资源体积巨大，分包尤其重要。</li>\n<li><strong>默认语言内置、其余 DLC 下载</strong>：安装包只含一两种主语言，其余语言作为可选下载内容。</li>\n<li><strong>字体子集化</strong>：<a href=\"../technical/fonts-multilingual-rendering\">CJK 字体</a>体积大，按实际用到的字形子集化打包。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>包体节省可粗略估算为：若全量打包大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>all</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>shared</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{all}} = S_{\\text{shared}} + \\sum_i S_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">all</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">shared</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个 locale 的专属资源），按需加载后实际下载约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>shared</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>selected</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{shared}} + S_{\\text{selected}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">shared</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">selected</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，对单语言玩家可节省 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mtext>selected</mtext></mrow></msub><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{i \\neq \\text{selected}} S_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\"><span class=\"mord vbox mtight\"><span class=\"thinbox mtight\"><span class=\"rlap mtight\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak mtight\"></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span></span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">selected</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这正是大型多语言游戏的标准做法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"文化敏感资源的处理\">文化敏感资源的处理</h2><p>资源本地化与<a href=\"../foundations/cultural-adaptation\">文化适配</a>在此交汇。某些图像不是「翻译」问题，而是「能不能出现」的问题：宗教符号、政治敏感地图、暴力/血腥画面、特定手势，可能需要为某些区域替换或移除整张资源。</p>\n<p>处理这类内容的关键是<strong>早识别、早分离</strong>。文化顾问应在资源生产期就标记出潜在敏感资源，把它们设计成可按 locale 替换的结构，而不是上线前才发现某张图在某国不能用、被迫紧急下架。区域专属的<strong>法律合规资源</strong>也属此类：某些国家强制要求显示游戏分级标志、防沉迷/健康提示、特定运营信息，这些必须作为 locale 专属资源注入，并在 <a href=\"../practice/lqa-testing\">LQA</a> 阶段逐区域核对是否齐全合规。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>可本地化资源远超贴图文字，涵盖图标、非语音音频、过场动画、法律标识等，字符串表对它们无能为力。</li>\n<li>首选「美术与文字分层」——文字用动态渲染叠加，换语言不动美术；必须烧进贴图的才用按 locale 覆盖加载。</li>\n<li>从设计期分离「可本地化资源」与「通用资源」，建立缺失即回退到默认 locale 的覆盖机制。</li>\n<li>多语言资源量成倍增长，需按 locale 分包、按需下载、字体子集化，控制包体（移动平台尤其关键）。</li>\n<li>文化敏感与法律合规资源要早识别、早分离设计成可替换结构，并在 LQA 阶段逐区域核对齐全合规。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"资源与图像本地化","id":"资源与图像本地化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"资源分离与命名约定","id":"资源分离与命名约定"},{"level":2,"text":"按区域加载与包体优化","id":"按区域加载与包体优化"},{"level":2,"text":"文化敏感资源的处理","id":"文化敏感资源的处理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"配音与字幕","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-localization/content/voiceover-subtitles"},"next":{"title":"术语库与翻译记忆","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-localization/content/terminology-translation-memory"}}